# DNB Knowledge Graph Exploration Report

## Overview
The Deutsche Nationalbibliothek (DNB) SPARQL endpoint provides access to a comprehensive knowledge graph containing bibliographic data, authority records (GND - Gemeinsame Normdatei), and related metadata. This is a **single-graph** knowledge base without named graphs.

