## Step 3 : Describe sample entities

### 1. **http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Document**
- **Sample URI:** https://d-nb.info/1000000001
- **Triples:** 24
- **Key Properties:** Title, author, creator, publication date, language, medium, subject (DDC), extent, identifiers, RDA content/carrier/media types, sameAs links

### 2. **http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Issue**
- **Sample URI:** https://d-nb.info/1000005372
- **Triples:** 14
- **Key Properties:** Identifier, isPartOf (series), issued date, medium, page range, RDA types, primaryTopic (URL), sameAs links

### 3. **http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Article**
- **Sample URI:** https://d-nb.info/1000052079
- **Triples:** 20
- **Key Properties:** Title, authors (with blank node name structures), identifiers, isPartOf, issued date, medium, RDA types, primaryTopic, sameAs links

### 4. **https://d-nb.info/standards/elementset/gnd#DifferentiatedPerson**
- **Sample URI:** https://d-nb.info/gnd/100000193
- **Triples:** 69
- **Key Properties:** Preferred name, variant names (many), forename/surname structures, date of birth/death, gender, geographic area code, place of activity/birth/death, profession, familial relationships (hasChild, hasParent), publications, sameAs links (VIAF, Wikidata, ISNI), biographical information

### 5. **http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Seq**
- **Note:** No IRI-based entities found; only blank nodes exist (used as RDF container structures)

### 6. **http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept**
- **Note:** No IRI-based entities found; only blank nodes exist

### 7. **http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Series**
- **Sample URI:** https://d-nb.info/1009662007
- **Triples:** 20
- **Key Properties:** Title(s), alternative title, publisher, issued date, medium, RDA types, publication places, sameAs links

### 8. **https://d-nb.info/standards/elementset/gnd#CorporateBody**
- **Sample URI:** https://d-nb.info/gnd/10000001-0
- **Triples:** 10
- **Key Properties:** Preferred name, variant name, place of business, homepage, geographic area code, GND identifier, sameAs links

### 9. **http://schema.org/MusicRelease**
- **Sample URI:** https://d-nb.info/100000001X
- **Triples:** 17
- **Key Properties:** Title, publisher, performer, issued date, product ID, extent, RDA content/carrier/media types, sameAs links

### 10. **https://d-nb.info/standards/elementset/gnd#ConferenceOrEvent**
- **Sample URI:** https://d-nb.info/gnd/10000076-9
- **Triples:** 10
- **Key Properties:** Preferred name, date, place, geographic area code, succeeding conference, GND identifier, sameAs links

---

**Summary:** All successfully sampled entities (8 out of 10 types) had ≤ 200 triples, allowing full DESCRIBE queries. The DNB KB entities are richly described with bibliographic metadata (RDA, Dublin Core), authority control (GND identifiers, variant names), and external links (sameAs to VIAF, Wikidata, etc.). Two types (Seq and Concept) only exist as blank nodes within the graph.

